        "snippet": "Skip to main content\n\n# Joint (NASDAQ:JYNT) Rating Increased to Strong-Buy at Wall Street Zen\n\nPosted by ABMN Staff on May 30th, 2026\n\nShare on Twitter Share on Facebook Share on LinkedIn Share on Stocktwits\n\nJoint (NASDAQ:JYNT – Get Free Report) was upgraded by analysts at Wall Street Zen from a “buy” rating to a “strong-buy” rating in a research report issued to clients and investors on Saturday.\n\nGet Joint alerts:\n\nJYNT has been the subject of a number of other research reports. Zacks Research upgraded shares of Joint from a “hold” rating to a “strong-buy” rating in a report on Tuesday, May 12th. Weiss Ratings raised shares of Joint from a “sell (d)” rating to a “sell (d+)” rating in a research report on Wednesday, May 20th. One investment analyst has rated the stock with a Strong Buy rating, one has given a Hold rating and one has assigned a Sell rating to the company. According to MarketBeat.com, Joint currently has a consensus rating of “Hold” and an average price target of $18.0",
